# Vercel deploy exclusion.
#
# Only the basename collision is excluded. The lambda entrypoint (index.js)
# loads dist/prod.mjs, which at boot imports dist/server.js to read the route
# table (dynamicRoutes) — an ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND at cold start if this file
# is missing. The old 39-named-export crash this file once caused is fixed at
# the build: tools/build.mjs gives dist/server.js a default export satisfying
# the launcher contract, so the name collision can no longer happen — the
# entry just wins.
dist/server.js.br
